-- title: Atlas API is not responding
-- description: The public key endpoint of the Atlas API does not answer. Central cannot manage servers.
-- severity: High
-- url: {atlas_url}/api/atlas/jwks.json
-- region: all
-- expected_text: "keys"
-- timeout: 10
-- pending_for: 180
-- resolve_after: 300
-- runbook_url: https://github.com/frappe/atlas/blob/develop/beacon/runbooks/atlas-api-unreachable.md
-- Beacon calls the public key set of the Atlas API from outside the region. It needs the web workers, so it fails when the scheduler runs but the API is down. Central cannot create, start or stop servers then.
